# MoveToDepth
# This action instructs the motor to lower to the current depth.

# Goal

float32 depth  # m
float32 velocity  # m/s

---

# Result

# The matching DepthProfile carries this same UUID.
string uuid

builtin_interfaces/Duration time_elapsed

---

# Feedback

builtin_interfaces/Duration time_elapsed

float32 depth  # m
float32 velocity  # m/s
